<section id="view-tool" class="view">
  <header class="hero hero-sm">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <div class="eyebrow">사주</div>
      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(28px,4.6vw,46px);">무슨 날짜가<br>궁금하신가요</h1>
      <p class="hero-copy">결혼식·이사·개업·계약체결 같은 중요한 날짜부터, 오늘의 운세와 사주 핵심까지 한 곳에서 확인하세요.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="block" style="padding-top:10px; padding-bottom:0;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:640px;">
      <div class="saju-event-cards">
        <div class="saju-event-card" onclick="selectEventAndFocus('결혼식')">
          <span class="ec-halo"></span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#d7b46a" stroke-width="1.5"><circle class="ec-ring1" cx="9" cy="14" r="5"/><circle class="ec-ring2" cx="15" cy="14" r="5"/></svg>
          <h3>결혼식</h3><p>예식 날짜 고르기</p>
        </div>
        <div class="saju-event-card" onclick="selectEventAndFocus('이사')">
          <span class="ec-halo"></span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#d7b46a" stroke-width="1.5"><g class="ec-bounce"><path d="M4 20V10l8-6 8 6v10H4z"/><path d="M9 20v-6h6v6"/></g></svg>
          <h3>이사</h3><p>입주 날짜 고르기</p>
        </div>
        <div class="saju-event-card" onclick="selectEventAndFocus('개업')">
          <span class="ec-halo"></span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#d7b46a" stroke-width="1.5"><circle class="ec-pop" cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/><path class="ec-spin2" d="M12 2v3M12 19v3M2 12h3M19 12h3M4.9 4.9l2.1 2.1M17 17l2.1 2.1M4.9 19.1L7 17M17 7l2.1-2.1"/></svg>
          <h3>개업</h3><p>오픈일 고르기</p>
        </div>
        <div class="saju-event-card" onclick="selectEventAndFocus('계약체결')">
          <span class="ec-halo"></span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#d7b46a" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="5" y="3" width="14" height="18" rx="1"/><path class="ec-draw" d="M8 8h8M8 12h8M8 16h5"/></svg>
          <h3>계약체결</h3><p>서명일 고르기</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block" style="padding-top:10px; display:none;" id="toolFormAnchor">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:720px;">
      <div class="tool-shell">
        <p class="lead" id="toolSelectedLabel">생년월일과 가능한 기간만 알려주세요. 좋은 후보부터 비교해서 보여드릴게요.</p>
        <div class="tool-date-mode" role="group" aria-label="택일 방식">
          <button type="button" aria-pressed="true" data-date-mode="range">기간으로 찾기</button>
          <button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-date-mode="exact">두 날짜 비교</button>
        </div>
        <div class="tool-exact-dates" hidden>
          <h2 tabindex="-1" id="toolExactTitle">후보 날짜 비교</h2>
          <p>후보일 두 개는 양력 날짜로 고르고, 아래에 생년월일을 입력해 주세요.</p>
          <div class="form-grid">
            <div class="field"><label for="exactDateFirst">첫 번째 후보일</label><input type="date" id="exactDateFirst"></div>
            <div class="field"><label for="exactDateSecond">두 번째 후보일</label><input type="date" id="exactDateSecond"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="event-opts" id="eventPicker" style="display:none;">
          <div class="event-opt active" data-val="결혼식">결혼식</div>
          <div class="event-opt" data-val="이사">이사</div>
          <div class="event-opt" data-val="개업">개업</div>
          <div class="event-opt" data-val="계약체결">계약체결</div>
        </div>

        <div class="field full" style="margin-bottom:8px;">
          <label>달력 기준</label>
          <div class="cal-type-toggle" id="birthCalType">
            <span class="ct-btn active" data-type="solar">양력</span>
            <span class="ct-btn" data-type="lunar">음력</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <label class="couple-row" id="birthLockWrap" style="margin-bottom:14px;">
          <span class="switch"><input type="checkbox" id="birthLock" onchange="onBirthLockToggle('birth')"></span>
          이 생년월일 고정하기 (다른 곳에서도 자동으로 채워져요)
        </label>

        <div class="field full" style="margin-top:16px;">
          <label>생년월일</label>
          <p class="privacy-input-note">만 14세 미만 아동 정보는 입력하지 마세요.</p>
          <div class="ymd-row">
            <select id="birthYear" class="ymd-select" aria-label="본인 출생연도"></select>
            <select id="birthMonth" class="ymd-select" aria-label="본인 출생월"></select>
            <select id="birthDay" class="ymd-select" aria-label="본인 출생일"></select>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field full">
          <label>태어난 시(모르면 비워두세요)</label>
          <input type="time" id="birthTime">
        </div>
        <input type="hidden" id="birthDate">
        <label class="couple-row" id="birthLeapWrap" style="display:none;">
          <span class="switch"><input type="checkbox" id="birthLeap"><span class="switch-track"><span class="switch-thumb"></span></span></span>
          윤달이에요
        </label>

        <div class="saju-preview" id="sajuPreview">
          <div class="sp-ganji" id="sajuGanji"></div>
          <div>
            <div class="sp-label">내 일주(日柱) · 타고난 기운</div>
            <div id="sajuOhaeng" style="margin-top:3px;"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <label class="couple-row">
          <span class="switch"><input type="checkbox" id="coupleToggle"><span class="switch-track"><span class="switch-thumb"></span></span></span>
          상대방도 함께 분석할게요 · 결혼식이라면 켜주세요
        </label>
        <div id="coupleFields" style="display:none;">
          <div class="field full">
            <label>상대방 생년월일</label>
            <div class="ymd-row">
              <select id="partnerYear" class="ymd-select" aria-label="상대방 출생연도"></select>
              <select id="partnerMonth" class="ymd-select" aria-label="상대방 출생월"></select>
              <select id="partnerDay" class="ymd-select" aria-label="상대방 출생일"></select>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="field full">
            <label>상대방 태어난 시(선택)</label>
            <input type="time" id="partnerBirthTime">
          </div>
          <input type="hidden" id="partnerBirthDate">
        </div>
        <div class="cal-type-toggle" id="partnerCalType" style="display:none; margin-bottom:14px;">
          <span class="ct-btn active" data-type="solar">양력</span>
          <span class="ct-btn" data-type="lunar">음력</span>
        </div>
        <label class="couple-row" id="partnerLeapWrap" style="display:none;">
          <span class="switch"><input type="checkbox" id="partnerLeap"><span class="switch-track"><span class="switch-thumb"></span></span></span>
          윤달이에요
        </label>

        <div class="form-grid tool-range-dates">
          <div class="field"><label>찾아볼 기간 시작</label><input type="date" id="rangeStart"></div>
          <div class="field"><label>찾아볼 기간 끝</label><input type="date" id="rangeEnd"></div>
        </div>

        <button class="btn btn-primary form-submit" id="submitBtn">좋은 날짜 찾아보기</button>
        <div class="tool-exact-output" hidden>
          <p class="tool-exact-error" role="alert"></p>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary form-submit" id="compareExactDates">선택한 두 날짜 비교하기</button>
          <section class="tool-exact-results" aria-labelledby="toolExactResultTitle" hidden></section>
        </div>
        <div id="loadingLine" class="loading-line" style="display:none;"><span class="spinner"></span>사주와 일진을 대조하는 중입니다…</div>

        <div id="results">
          <div class="result-intro">
            <div>
              <div class="results-heading" id="resultsHeading"></div>
              <div class="results-sub" id="resultsSub"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="result-count" id="resultCount"></div>
          </div>
          <div id="bestResultHero" class="best-result-hero" style="display:none;"></div>

          <div class="filter-chips">
            <span class="filter-chip active" data-mode="all" onclick="applyDowFilter('all')">전체 요일</span>
            <span class="filter-chip" data-mode="weekend" onclick="applyDowFilter('weekend')">주말만</span>
            <span class="filter-chip" data-mode="weekday" onclick="applyDowFilter('weekday')">평일만</span>
          </div>

          <div class="result-grid" id="dateCards"></div>
          <div id="premiumUpsell" style="display:none;"></div>

          <div class="calendar-wrap" id="calendarWrap"></div>
          <div class="cal-legend">
            <span><i style="background:rgba(215,180,106,.35)"></i>추천</span>
            <span><i style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.08)"></i>보통</span>
            <span><i style="background:rgba(201,131,106,.3)"></i>주의</span>
            <span><i style="background:var(--gold-hi);border-radius:50%;width:6px;height:6px;"></i>손없는 날</span>
          </div>
          <div class="day-detail" id="dayDetail" style="display:none;"></div>

          <div id="premiumProgramPanel" class="premium-program-panel" style="display:none;"></div>
          <div class="reset-row">
            <span class="text-action" onclick="printResults()">🖨 인쇄 / PDF 저장</span>
            <span class="text-action" onclick="resetTool()">다시 검색하기</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <div class="section-kicker">간편사주</div>
          <h2 class="section-title">다른 사주 서비스도<br>함께 볼 수 있어요</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="section-desc">날짜를 정하기 전에, 오늘의 운세와 내 사주 핵심부터 가볍게 확인해보세요.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="saju-hub-grid">
        <button class="saju-hub-card" onclick="openFortuneModal('today')">
          <svg class="saju-hub-art" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="13" fill="var(--gold-hi)"/><g class="sh-twinkle"><line x1="32" y1="6" x2="32" y2="15" stroke="var(--gold-hi)" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="32" y1="49" x2="32" y2="58" stroke="var(--gold-hi)" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="6" y1="32" x2="15" y2="32" stroke="var(--gold-hi)" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="49" y1="32" x2="58" y2="32" stroke="var(--gold-hi)" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></g></svg>
          <span class="saju-hub-kicker">FREE · TODAY</span>
          <strong>오늘의 운세</strong>
          <small>생년월일을 넣고 오늘의 기운을 바로 확인</small>
          <b>무료로 보기 →</b>
        </button>
        <button class="saju-hub-card featured" onclick="openSajuInsight('profile')">
          <svg class="saju-hub-art" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="22" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold-hi)" stroke-width="1.4"/><path class="sh-spin" d="M32 10a22 22 0 0 1 0 44 11 11 0 0 1 0-22 11 11 0 0 0 0-22z" fill="var(--gold-hi)" opacity=".9"/><circle class="sh-spin" cx="32" cy="21" r="3.4" fill="#0c0b09"/><circle cx="32" cy="43" r="3.4" fill="var(--gold-hi)"/></svg>
          <span class="saju-hub-kicker">FREE PREVIEW</span>
          <strong>내 사주 핵심</strong>
          <small>일주 · 오행 · 성향을 쉽고 짧게 먼저 확인</small>
          <b>무료로 보기 →</b>
        </button>
        <button class="saju-hub-card" onclick="openSajuInsight('year')">
          <svg class="saju-hub-art" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M40 14a18 18 0 1 0 10 32 14 14 0 0 1-10-32z" fill="var(--gold-hi)"/><circle class="sh-twinkle" cx="48" cy="16" r="2"/><circle class="sh-twinkle sh-d1" cx="54" cy="26" r="1.4"/><circle class="sh-twinkle sh-d2" cx="46" cy="30" r="1.1"/></svg>
          <span class="saju-hub-kicker">2026</span>
          <strong>올해의 흐름</strong>
          <small>연애 · 재물 · 일 · 인간관계의 올해 키워드</small>
          <b>올해 운세 →</b>
        </button>
        <button class="saju-hub-card" onclick="openSajuInsight('love')">
          <svg class="saju-hub-art" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path class="sh-pulse" d="M25 20c-6 0-11 5-11 11 0 12 14 19 18 21 4-2 18-9 18-21 0-6-5-11-11-11-3 0-5.5 1.4-7 3.6C30.5 21.4 28 20 25 20z" fill="var(--gold-hi)"/></svg>
          <span class="saju-hub-kicker">RELATIONSHIP</span>
          <strong>궁합·연애</strong>
          <small>두 사람의 오행 조화를 보고 중요한 날짜까지 연결</small>
          <b>궁합 보기 →</b>
        </button>
        <button class="saju-hub-card" onclick="openSajuInsight('money')">
          <svg class="saju-hub-art" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><g class="sh-float"><circle cx="32" cy="30" r="15" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold-hi)" stroke-width="2"/><text x="32" y="36" text-anchor="middle" font-size="15" fill="var(--gold-hi)" font-family="serif">財</text></g><ellipse cx="32" cy="49" rx="15" ry="3" fill="var(--gold-hi)" opacity=".18"/></svg>
          <span class="saju-hub-kicker">LIFE</span>
          <strong>재물·직업</strong>
          <small>내 기운에 맞는 선택과 주의 포인트를 간단히 확인</small>
          <b>핵심 보기 →</b>
        </button>
        <button class="saju-hub-card" onclick="openSajuInsight('monthly')">
          <svg class="saju-hub-art" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><rect x="14" y="16" width="36" height="32" rx="4" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold-hi)" stroke-width="1.6"/><line x1="14" y1="25" x2="50" y2="25" stroke="var(--gold-hi)" stroke-width="1.6"/><line x1="22" y1="10" x2="22" y2="20" stroke="var(--gold-hi)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="42" y1="10" x2="42" y2="20" stroke="var(--gold-hi)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/><g class="sh-sparkle"><circle cx="38" cy="36" r="4.4" fill="var(--gold-hi)"/></g></svg>
          <span class="saju-hub-kicker">CALENDAR</span>
          <strong>운세 캘린더</strong>
          <small>좋은 날을 찾는 흐름을 월별로 생각해볼 수 있어요</small>
          <b>날짜 찾기 →</b>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</section>

<!-- ============ HISTORY ============ -->
<section id="view-history" class="view">
  <header class="hero hero-sm">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <div class="eyebrow">내 기록</div>
      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(28px,4.6vw,46px);">찾아본 날짜와<br>저장한 사주를 한곳에</h1>
      <p class="hero-copy">상담사와 나눈 대화를 다시 열고, 택일 검색 기록과 저장한 사주를 한곳에서 관리할 수 있어요.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="block history-hub" style="padding-top:10px;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:760px;">

      <div class="history-summary-grid">
        <button class="history-summary-card active" id="historySummaryAi" onclick="switchHistoryTab('ai')">
          <span>AI 상담</span>
          <strong id="historyAiCount">0</strong>
          <small>상담사와 나눈 대화 이어보기</small>
        </button>

        <button class="history-summary-card" id="historySummarySearch" onclick="switchHistoryTab('search')">
          <span>검색 기록</span>
          <strong id="historySearchCount">0</strong>
          <small>지난 택일 결과 다시 보기</small>
        </button>

        <button class="history-summary-card" id="historySummaryVault" onclick="switchHistoryTab('vault')">
          <span>사주 보관함</span>
          <strong id="historyVaultCount">0</strong>
          <small>나와 소중한 사람들의 사주</small>
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="history-tabbar" role="tablist" aria-label="기록 종류">
        <button id="historyTabAi" class="history-tab active" role="tab" aria-selected="true" onclick="switchHistoryTab('ai')">AI 상담</button>
        <button id="historyTabSearch" class="history-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" onclick="switchHistoryTab('search')">검색 기록</button>
        <button id="historyTabVault" class="history-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" onclick="switchHistoryTab('vault')">사주 보관함</button>
      </div>

      <div id="historySearchPanel" class="history-panel">
        <div class="history-panel-head">
          <div>
            <b>택일 검색 기록</b>
            <small>이 브라우저에서 찾아본 추천 날짜가 저장돼요.</small>
          </div>
          <button class="history-clear-btn" id="historyClearBtn" onclick="clearAllSearchHistory()">전체 삭제</button>
        </div>

        <div id="historyList" class="usecase-list"></div>
        <div id="historyEmpty" class="empty-note history-empty-box" style="display:none;">
          아직 저장된 검색 기록이 없어요.<br>
          <button onclick="goTo('home')">날짜 찾아보기 →</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="historyVaultPanel" class="history-panel">
        <div class="saju-vault-card history-vault-card">
          <div class="saju-vault-head">
            <div>
              <b>사주 보관함</b>
              <small>가족·연인·사업 파트너의 사주를 저장하고 AI 상담에서 바로 불러오세요. 로그인 상태에서는 Firebase 계정과 동기화되고, 이 브라우저에도 백업됩니다.</small>
            </div>
            <button class="btn history-add-saju-btn" onclick="openAiProfileCreator()">+ 사주 추가</button>
          </div>

          <div class="history-vault-guide">
            <span>① 사주 저장</span>
            <i>→</i>
            <span>② 상담 대상 선택</span>
            <i>→</i>
            <span>③ AI에게 바로 질문</span>
          </div>

          <div id="sajuVaultList" class="saju-vault-list"></div>

          <div id="sajuVaultEmpty" class="empty-note history-empty-box">
            저장된 사주가 아직 없어요.<br>
            <button onclick="openAiProfileCreator()">첫 사주 저장하기 →</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="historyAiPanel" class="history-panel active">
        <div class="history-panel-head">
          <div>
            <b>AI 상담 기록</b>
            <small>상담사와 첫 질문을 확인하고, 지난 대화에서 이어서 질문할 수 있어요.</small>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="aiConversationHistoryList" class="ai-history-list"></div>
        <div id="aiConversationHistoryEmpty" class="empty-note history-empty-box">
          아직 저장된 AI 상담이 없어요.<br>
          <button onclick="goTo('home')">고민별 상담 둘러보기</button>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</section>

<!-- ============ PROFILE ============ -->
<section id="view-profile" class="view">
  <div class="pf-shell">
    <header class="pf-heading">
      <h1 id="profileHeading" tabindex="-1">내 프로필</h1>
    </header>
    <div class="pf-card">
      <div class="pf-avatar" id="profileAvatar" aria-hidden="true">택</div>
      <div class="pf-id">
        <div class="pf-name" id="profileName">이름</div>
        <div class="pf-meta" id="profileMeta">로그인 방식</div>
        <div class="pf-badge-row">
          <span class="pf-badge" id="profileTier">무료 회원</span>
          <span class="pf-expiry" id="premiumExpiry" style="display:none;"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="pf-uid" id="profileUidRow" style="display:none;">
          <span>회원 UID</span>
          <code id="profileUid"></code>
          <button type="button" onclick="copyProfileUid()" aria-label="회원 UID 복사">복사</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pf-panels">
      <section class="pf-panel pf-plan" aria-labelledby="profilePlanHeading">
        <h2 id="profilePlanHeading">이용권</h2>
        <p id="profilePremiumPriceNote">8,900원 / 30일 · 자동결제 없음 · AI 상담 하루 10개</p>
        <p class="checkout-pause-note" data-checkout-paused>신규 이용권 구매를 잠시 중단했습니다.</p>
        <button type="button" class="pf-upgrade" id="profileUpgradeBtn" data-checkout-action onclick="payPremium()">프리미엄 30일 · 8,900원 구매</button>
        <button type="button" class="profile-plan-guide" onclick="goTo('plans')">이용권 안내</button>
      </section>
      <section class="pf-panel" aria-labelledby="profileLibraryHeading">
        <h2 id="profileLibraryHeading">나의 리포트와 기록</h2>
        <div class="pf-menu">
          <button type="button" class="pf-menu-item" data-open-newyear>나의 2027 신년 리포트</button>
          <button type="button" class="pf-menu-item" onclick="goTo('history')">내 기록 · 사주 보관함</button>
          <button type="button" class="pf-menu-item" onclick="goTo('support')">고객센터 · 1:1 문의</button>
          <div id="adminEntryWrap" style="display:none;">
            <button type="button" class="pf-menu-item" onclick="goTo('admin')">관리자 대시보드</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <section class="pf-panel" id="profilePrivacySettings" aria-labelledby="profilePrivacyHeading">
      <h2 id="profilePrivacyHeading">개인정보 설정</h2>
      <p><strong>AI 상담 개인정보 국외 이전</strong></p>
      <p id="profileAIConsentStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite">동의 상태를 확인하고 있어요.</p>
      <div class="pf-danger-row">
        <button type="button" id="profileGrantAIConsent" class="text-action" hidden>동의 내용 확인</button>
        <button type="button" id="profileWithdrawAIConsent" class="text-action" hidden>동의 철회</button>
        <button type="button" id="profileRetryAIConsent" class="text-action" hidden>다시 확인</button>
        <a class="text-action" href="/?privacy=ai#legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">처리방침 8항</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pf-account-actions" aria-labelledby="profileAccountHeading">
      <h2 id="profileAccountHeading">계정 관리</h2>
      <p class="pf-danger-note">회원탈퇴 시 동일 계정으로 30일간 재가입할 수 없습니다. 무료 3회 혜택도 재가입 제한 기간이 지난 뒤에만 다시 가입할 수 있어요.</p>
      <div class="pf-danger-row">
        <button type="button" class="text-action" onclick="logout()">로그아웃</button>
        <button type="button" class="text-action pf-delete" onclick="confirmDeleteAccount()">회원탈퇴</button>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ SUPPORT (1:1 문의) ============ -->
<section id="view-support" class="view">
  <header class="hero hero-sm">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <div class="eyebrow">고객센터</div>
      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(28px,4.6vw,46px);">1:1 문의</h1>
      <p class="hero-copy">궁금한 점이나 불편한 점을 남겨주시면 확인 후 답변드릴게요. 내 문의는 나만 볼 수 있어요.</p>
    </div>
  </header>
  <section class="block" style="padding-top:10px;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:700px;">
      <a href="mailto:contact@taekilso.com" class="support-email-link"><span>이메일 문의</span><strong>contact@taekilso.com</strong></a><p class="support-email-note">메일 주소를 눌러 이메일 앱에서 문의하실 수 있어요.</p>
      <div class="tool-shell">
        <h2>새 문의 작성</h2>
        <p class="lead">로그인 후 이용할 수 있어요. 작성한 문의와 답변은 이 목록에서 확인할 수 있어요.</p>
        <div class="field full" style="margin-bottom:14px;">
          <label>자주 있는 결제 문의 (누르면 아래 제목·내용이 자동으로 채워져요)</label>
          <div style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; margin-top:8px;">
            <button type="button" class="btn" style="padding:8px 16px; min-height:auto; font-size:12.5px;" onclick="fillCommonInquiry('paymentFailed')">💳 결제가 안 됐어요</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn" style="padding:8px 16px; min-height:auto; font-size:12.5px;" onclick="fillCommonInquiry('premiumNotOpen')">🔒 결제했는데 프리미엄이 안 열려요</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn" style="padding:8px 16px; min-height:auto; font-size:12.5px;" onclick="requestRefund()">↩️ 환불하고 싶어요</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field full" style="margin-bottom:12px;">
          <label for="supportType">문의 종류</label>
          <select id="supportType"><option value="">문의 종류 선택</option><option value="general">일반 이용 문의</option><option value="dispute">결제·환불·소비자 불만 또는 분쟁</option></select>
          <label for="supportTitle">제목</label>
          <input type="text" id="supportTitle" placeholder="예: 결제가 안 돼요">
        </div>
        <div class="field full" style="margin-bottom:8px;">
          <label>내용</label>
          <textarea id="supportMessage" rows="5" placeholder="자세한 상황을 알려주세요." style="width:100%; padding:14px 15px; background:#090908; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10); border-radius:14px; color:var(--white); font-family:inherit; font-size:14px; resize:vertical;"></textarea>
        </div>
        <button class="btn btn-primary form-submit" onclick="submitInquiry()">문의 등록하기</button>
        <div id="supportStatus" style="display:none; margin-top:12px; padding:12px 14px; border-radius:12px; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6;"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="section-head" style="margin-top:40px;">
        <div><div class="section-kicker">MY INQUIRIES</div><h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:22px;">내 문의 내역</h2></div>
      </div>
      <div id="supportList" class="usecase-list"></div>
      <div id="supportEmpty" class="empty-note" style="display:none;">아직 등록한 문의가 없어요.</div>
      <div id="supportDetail" class="day-detail" style="display:none;"></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</section>

<!-- ============ ADMIN ============ -->
<section id="view-admin" class="view">
  <header class="hero hero-sm">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <div class="eyebrow">관리자</div>
      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(28px,4.6vw,46px);">운영 현황</h1>
      <p class="hero-copy">방문·가입·구매 통계와 회원 목록을 확인할 수 있어요.</p>
    </div>
  </header>
  <section class="block" style="padding-top:10px;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px;">
      <div id="adminDenied" style="display:none; text-align:center; color:var(--muted); padding:40px 0;">관리자 계정으로 로그인해야 볼 수 있어요.</div>
      <div id="adminContent" style="display:none;">
<section id="adminAnalytics" hidden aria-label="기간별 운영 분석"></section>
<div class="admin-menu-overview" aria-label="관리자 전체 메뉴">
  <button type="button" onclick="openAndGoAdminFold('adminFoldStats')"><small>OVERVIEW</small>운영 현황</button>
  <button type="button" onclick="openAndGoAdminFold('adminFoldFunnel')"><small>FUNNEL</small>오늘 주요 행동</button>
  <button type="button" onclick="openAdminTrafficMenu()"><small>TRAFFIC</small>오늘 유입 경로</button>
  <button type="button" onclick="openAndGoAdminFold('adminFoldSeo')"><small>SEO</small>SEO 성과</button>
  <button type="button" onclick="openAndGoAdminFold('adminFoldMembers')"><small>MEMBERS</small>회원 관리</button>
  <button type="button" onclick="openAndGoAdminFold('adminFoldBans')"><small>BANNED</small>영구 밴 관리</button>
  <button type="button" onclick="openAndGoAdminFold('adminFoldSupport')"><small>SUPPORT</small>1:1 문의 관리</button>
</div>
</div>

<div class="admin-fold" id="adminFoldStats">
  <button type="button" class="admin-fold-toggle" onclick="toggleAdminFold('adminFoldStats')" aria-expanded="false">
    <span class="admin-fold-title"><small>OVERVIEW</small><b>운영 통계</b></span>
    <span class="admin-fold-chevron">⌄</span>
  </button>
  <div class="admin-fold-body">
        <div id="adminStatsStatus" class="admin-data-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
        <div class="admin-stats">
          <div class="admin-stat"><small>누적 방문수</small><b id="statVisits">–</b></div>
          <div class="admin-stat"><small>오늘 방문수 · 00시 초기화</small><b id="statTodayVisits">–</b></div>
          <div class="admin-stat"><small>총 가입자수</small><b id="statSignups">–</b></div>
          <div class="admin-stat"><small>카카오 가입자</small><b id="statKakaoMembers">–</b></div>
          <div class="admin-stat"><small>오늘 접속 회원</small><b id="statActiveToday">–</b></div>
          <div class="admin-stat"><small>최근 7일 접속</small><b id="statActive7d">–</b></div>
          <div class="admin-stat"><small>총 구매수</small><b id="statPurchases">–</b></div>
          <div class="admin-stat"><small>누적 매출</small><b id="statRevenue" style="font-size:20px;">–</b></div>
          <div class="admin-stat"><small>현재 프리미엄 회원</small><b id="statActivePremium">–</b></div>
          <div class="admin-stat"><small>프리미엄 구매수</small><b id="statPurchasesPremium">–</b></div>
          <div class="admin-stat"><small>질문권 구매수</small><b id="statPurchasesQuestionPacks">–</b></div>
          <div class="admin-stat"><small>답변 대기 문의</small><b id="statPendingInquiries" style="color:var(--warn);">–</b></div>
        </div>


  </div>
</div>

<div class="admin-fold" id="adminFoldFunnel">
  <button type="button" class="admin-fold-toggle" onclick="toggleAdminFold('adminFoldFunnel')" aria-expanded="false">
    <span class="admin-fold-title"><small>TODAY FUNNEL · KST</small><b>오늘 주요 행동</b></span>
    <span class="admin-fold-chevron">⌄</span>
  </button>
  <div class="admin-fold-body">
        <div class="section-head" style="margin-top:40px;">
          <div>
            <div class="section-kicker">TODAY FUNNEL · KST</div>
            <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:24px;">오늘 주요 행동</h2>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="price-note" style="margin:0 0 14px;">
          한국시간 00:00 기준 · 서로 독립적인 행동 건수이며, 동일 이용자의 단계별 전환율이 아닙니다.
        </div>
        <div id="adminFunnelGrid" class="admin-stats" style="margin-bottom:10px;">
          <div class="admin-stat"><small>방문</small><b id="funnelVisits">0</b><span id="funnelVisitsRate" style="font-size:9px;color:var(--muted-2);">기준</span></div>
          <div class="admin-stat"><small>오늘의 운세 결과</small><b id="funnelFortune">0</b><span id="funnelFortuneRate" style="font-size:9px;color:var(--muted-2);">0%</span></div>
          <div class="admin-stat"><small>연우 CTA 클릭</small><b id="funnelAiCta">0</b><span id="funnelAiCtaRate" style="font-size:9px;color:var(--muted-2);">0%</span></div>
          <div class="admin-stat"><small>신규 가입</small><b id="funnelSignup">0</b><span id="funnelSignupRate" style="font-size:9px;color:var(--muted-2);">0%</span></div>
          <div class="admin-stat"><small>첫 AI 답변</small><b id="funnelFirstAi">0</b><span id="funnelFirstAiRate" style="font-size:9px;color:var(--muted-2);">0%</span></div>
          <div class="admin-stat"><small>무료 3회 소진</small><b id="funnelFreeDone">0</b><span id="funnelFreeDoneRate" style="font-size:9px;color:var(--muted-2);">0%</span></div>
          <div class="admin-stat"><small>결제 완료</small><b id="funnelPurchase">0</b><span id="funnelPurchaseRate" style="font-size:9px;color:var(--muted-2);">0%</span></div>
        </div>
        <div id="adminFunnelHint" class="price-note" style="margin:0 0 24px;">오늘 데이터가 쌓이면 가장 큰 이탈 구간을 자동으로 표시합니다.</div>


  </div>
</div>

<div class="admin-fold" id="adminFoldSeo">
  <button type="button" class="admin-fold-toggle" onclick="toggleAdminFold('adminFoldSeo')" aria-expanded="false">
    <span class="admin-fold-title"><small>SEO · KST</small><b>SEO 성과</b></span><span class="admin-fold-chevron">⌄</span>
  </button>
  <div class="admin-fold-body">
    <div class="price-note" style="margin:16px 0 12px;">검색 가이드에서 메인 상담으로 넘어온 세션을 익명 집계합니다. 질문·사주·이메일은 저장하지 않습니다.</div>
    <div id="adminSeoSummary" class="admin-stats" style="margin-bottom:12px;">
      <div class="admin-stat"><small>SEO 상담 유입</small><b id="seoVisits">0</b></div>
      <div class="admin-stat"><small>가입</small><b id="seoSignups">0</b></div>
      <div class="admin-stat"><small>첫 AI 답변</small><b id="seoFirstAi">0</b></div>
      <div class="admin-stat"><small>무료 3회 소진</small><b id="seoFreeDone">0</b></div>
      <div class="admin-stat"><small>결제 완료</small><b id="seoPurchases">0</b></div>
      <div class="admin-stat"><small>SEO→결제</small><b id="seoPurchaseRate">0%</b></div>
    </div>
    <div id="adminSeoLandingRows" class="price-note" style="margin:0 0 24px;">SEO 유입 데이터가 쌓이면 랜딩페이지별 성과를 표시합니다.</div>
  </div>
</div>

        <div id="adminTrafficMenuAnchor" style="scroll-margin-top:150px"></div>
        <button id="adminTrafficSourceCard" class="admin-traffic-card" type="button" onclick="toggleAdminTrafficSources()" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="trafficSourceDetails">
          <span class="admin-traffic-heading">
            <span class="admin-fold-title"><small>TODAY TRAFFIC · KST</small><b>오늘 유입 경로 <span id="trafficSourceTotal">0명</span></b></span>
            <span id="trafficSourceChevron" class="admin-fold-chevron" aria-hidden="true">⌄</span>
          </span>
          <span id="trafficSourceSummary">검색 0 · SNS 0 · 직접 0 · 기타 0</span>
          <span id="trafficSourceDetails" style="display:none;"></span>
        </button>

<div class="admin-fold" id="adminFoldMembers">
  <button type="button" class="admin-fold-toggle" onclick="toggleAdminFold('adminFoldMembers')" aria-expanded="false">
    <span class="admin-fold-title"><small>MEMBERS</small><b>회원 관리</b></span>
    <span class="admin-fold-chevron">⌄</span>
  </button>
  <div class="admin-fold-body">
        <div class="section-head" style="margin-top:40px;">
          <div><div class="section-kicker">MEMBERS</div><h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:24px;">회원 목록</h2></div>
        </div>
        <div class="admin-member-tools" style="margin-bottom:14px;">
          <div class="field full" style="margin:0;flex:1;min-width:0;">
            <input type="text" id="adminUserSearch" placeholder="이메일/닉네임/UID/가입방식으로 검색" oninput="filterAdminUserList(this.value)" style="width:100%; padding:12px 14px; background:#090908; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10); border-radius:12px; color:var(--white); font-family:inherit; font-size:13.5px;">
          </div>
          <select id="adminMemberSort" class="admin-member-sort" onchange="setAdminMemberSort(this.value)" aria-label="회원 정렬">
            <option value="recent_signup">최근 가입순</option>
            <option value="recent_access">최근 접속순</option>
            <option value="premium_first">프리미엄 우선</option>
            <option value="credits_desc">질문권 많은순</option>
            <option value="old_signup">오래된 가입순</option>
            <option value="name">이름순</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="price-note" style="margin-top:0; margin-bottom:14px;">⚠ 자가확인(대조 필요) — 서버 검증 없이 손님이 직접 "결제했다"고 눌러서 켜진 프리미엄이에요. 페이앱 결제현황에서 시간·금액이 실제로 맞는지 한 번 대조해보시는 걸 권해요. 표시가 없으면(서버 검증 또는 관리자 직접 지급) 대조하지 않으셔도 돼요.</div>
        <div id="adminMembersStatus" class="admin-data-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
        <div id="adminUserList" class="usecase-list"></div>
        <div class="price-note" style="margin-top:20px;">※ 최근 접속시간은 이 버전 배포 후 로그인/재접속한 회원부터 기록됩니다. 문의 이력이 있으면 최근 문의가 표시됩니다. 프리미엄 회원 정보가 일부 누락되어도 서버의 결제 완료 기록(paymentOrders)을 기준으로 자동 복구하며, 관리자 회수 이력이 더 최신인 경우에는 복구하지 않습니다.</div>


  </div>
</div>

